    "text": "with Devices; use Devices;\n\nprocedure Show_Device is\n   D : Device;\n   I : Device_Info;\nbegin\n   Turn_On (D);\n   I := Current_Info (D);\n\n   Turn_Off (D);\n\n   --  The following call raises\n   --  an exception at runtime\n   --  because D is turned off.\n   I := Current_Info (D);\nend Show_Device;\n",
